## Import
Import the MCP Config Secret resource by using the Project ID, MCP Config ID, and Secret ID in the format `PROJECT_ID/MCP_CONFIG_ID/SECRET_ID`, e.g.
```
$ terraform import mongodbatlas_project_mcp_config_secret.test 6117ac2fe2a3d04ed27a987v/8423867e-394c-4f1e-9d81-32d323a1dd81/6a79adb34c91a97469c7fd1d
```

-> **NOTE:** `secret` and `masked_secret_value` are not populated during import and should be omitted in the resource definition when importing the resource.

For more information, see [Create One Secret for One Project MCP Configuration](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/operation/operation-creategroupmcpconfigsecret) in the MongoDB Atlas API documentation.
